<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F5F7F2', padding: '60px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A120E' }}>四周上线，先管住一条外发通道</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', marginTop: 10 }}>落地</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DDE4DC', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', marginTop: 30 }}>
        {[
            { w: '第 1 周', t: '立骨架', d: '建空间与目录树，导入成员，确定七级密级的显示名。' },
            { w: '第 2 周', t: '接身份', d: '接 LDAP / AD 或 SSO 断言，跑通登录、角色与停用。' },
            { w: '第 3 周', t: '管一条线', d: '选一个真实外发场景，配有效期、水印、审批阈值。' },
            { w: '第 4 周', t: '交证据', d: '导出审计样张，演练撤销链接与停用账号的收敛时间。' },
        ].map((s, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 258, background: i === 2 ? '#0F5C40' : '#EEF1EA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '22px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: i === 2 ? '#C6EE4B' : '#A9B5AE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>{s.w}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: i === 2 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#0A120E' }}>{s.t}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: i === 2 ? '#DDE4DC' : '#3F5148', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>{s.d}</Text>
                </Box>
                {i < 3 && <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#A9B5AE', width: 32, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text>}
            </Box>
        ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 32, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', letterSpacing: 2 }}>每周都要有一个能拿给老板看的东西</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
            {[
                '目录树与账号清单',
                '一次真实登录（含域账号）',
                '一条走完审批的外发链接',
                '一份按人/按时间的访问记录',
            ].map((t, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, borderTop: '2px solid #C6EE4B', paddingTop: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0A120E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{t}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, background: '#EEF1EA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0A120E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            不追求一次铺满全公司：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>先让一条外发通道闭环</span>，再复制到第二个部门。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 676, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>NeuroDMS · 产品概览</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>13</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
